flowchart TD
    REQ[Authenticated API Request]
    JWT[JWT Claim Verification]
    RBAC[Backend RBAC Check]
    ABAC[Resource Attribute Checks]
    RLS[Supabase RLS Policy Evaluation]
    ALLOW[Allow Data Access]
    DENY[Deny with 403]

    REQ --> JWT
    JWT -->|Invalid| DENY
    JWT -->|Valid| RBAC
    RBAC -->|Denied| DENY
    RBAC -->|Allowed| ABAC
    ABAC -->|Denied| DENY
    ABAC -->|Allowed| RLS
    RLS -->|Denied| DENY
    RLS -->|Allowed| ALLOW
